'''Chroma Boneblade''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a cutlass shaped blade with nine color alternating scratch marks all over it; three by the tip, two vertical marks by the ricasso, and four more horizontal marks also by the ricasso. Two triangle bits of the blade have been chipped off. The handle is made out of black bones with a color alternating grip attached to it. 

== Trivia ==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Boneblade]], which was found in the same box. 
*It was the first [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] weapon to ever be released in the game and was also the first holiday chroma.
*Like the other [[Chroma Weapons]], It lost a lot of value after [[The Duping Glitch (2019)]].
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*At one point, its [[Boneblade|regular counterpart]] was worth more.
*'''Chroma Boneblade''' is slightly bigger then its counterpart [[Boneblade]].

